<h1 data-copy-en="Vixen" data-copy-zh="Vixen">Vixen</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Vixen’s meeting places, six social lessons, dates and VIP Lounge recruitment." data-copy-zh="Vixen的会面地点、六项社交教学、约会与VIP休息室招募。">Vixen’s meeting places, six social lessons, dates and VIP Lounge recruitment.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find Vixen</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">Missing actions and useful checks</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">出现地点与时间</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">动作缺失时的检查</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Credits_and_Current_Scope"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="All23_Shared_Island_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sunset_Walk_with_Vixen"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sirena_Isle_Activities"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Two_Crafted_Training_Upgrades"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Worker_.2319_Setup_and_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Worker_#19_Setup_and_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="VIP_Lounge_Private_Time"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recruitment_and_Shared_Events"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Dates_and_Best_Choices"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Building_Affection_and_Six_Lessons"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Vixen — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/vixen.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Vixen — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/vixen.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Vixen — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Vixen can be met at several Medieval venues. She offers six social lessons, two dates and a later VIP Lounge branch. Use the venue windows and relationship conditions below to plan her activities.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Exact_Schedule"></span><h2>Where to find Vixen</h2><p>Start at Rowdy Alehouse on odd days 20:00–22:00. The introduction itself can trigger any day in that same evening window. At Acknowledged (10), visit Bards Guild on even days 18:00–22:00 or Thieves Guild on even days 22:00–24:00 and the following odd-day 00:00–02:00.</p><p>Noble Quarter requires Known (25): before recruitment, daily 14:00–18:00; after recruitment, even days only 15:00–18:00. Her recruited VIP Lounge portrait is available odd days 11:00–20:00 or even days 11:00–15:00. Recruitment retains the ordinary guild/alehouse appearances.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Location</th><th scope="col">Portrait schedule</th><th scope="col">Condition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Rowdy Alehouse</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">odd days, 20:00–22:00</td><td data-label="Condition">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Bards Guild</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">even days, 18:00–22:00</td><td data-label="Condition">Acknowledged (10)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Thieves Guild</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">even days, 22:00–24:00; odd days, 00:00–02:00</td><td data-label="Condition">Acknowledged (10)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Noble Quarter</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">before recruitment: daily 14–18; afterward: even days 15–18</td><td data-label="Condition">Known (25)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">VIP Lounge</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">odd days 11–20; even days 11–15</td><td data-label="Condition">recruited and active</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Windows refer to the time you start an action; the ending time is excluded.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>At Romantic (800) and business Reputation 10, enter Bards Guild on an even day 18:00–22:00 for A Strategic Partnership. Completion recruits her and opens the VIP Lounge at level 1. The lounge introduction is another visit after that.</p><p>The Noble Quarter Nature Walk and Bards Guild Sunset Walk are separate one-time dates. Each takes 120 minutes and 40 Energy with no money cost. Nature Walk requires Acquaintance (50) at her Noble Quarter portrait. Sunset starts on even days 18:00–20:00.</p><details><summary>Automatic encounters: complete start conditions</summary><p>Enter the indicated location during its scene window. These encounters complete once; fixed base relationship rewards below are separate from choice bonuses. A missing hour restriction means the scene itself has no extra clock gate.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Encounter</th><th scope="col">Start location / hours</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Fixed base relationship</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Vixen Tests Ava and Eva</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Massage Room; 12:00–24:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Ava and Eva Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Reader of Souls</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Rowdy Alehouse; 20:00–22:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Vixen Stranger (0); not vacationing: Vixen</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Vixen +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Art of Performance</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Bards Guild; even days, 16:00–20:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Vixen Friend (100); Sandra Friend (100); not vacationing: Sandra / Vixen</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Vixen +10 / Sandra +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Daylight Among Nobles</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Noble Quarter; 14:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Vixen Known (25); not vacationing: Vixen</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Vixen +8</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Strategic Partnership</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Bards Guild; even days, 18:00–22:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Vixen Romantic (800); business Reputation 10; not vacationing: Vixen</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Vixen +20</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Grand Opening</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">VIP Lounge; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">active recruited worker: Vixen; not vacationing: Elara / Vixen</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Vixen +5 / Elara +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Gentle Soul</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">VIP Lounge; 11:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">after The Grand Opening; active recruited worker: Pepper; not vacationing: Pepper / Vixen</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Vixen +5 / Pepper +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Shape of Things</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Bards Guild; even days, 18:00–22:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">after The Art of Performance / The Grand Opening; active recruited worker: Sandra / Vixen; not vacationing: Sandra / Vixen</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Vixen +5 / Sandra +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Velvet Approach</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Thieves Guild; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">Vixen Known (25); Thieves Guild Clout 5</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Vixen +4</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Arrangement</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Thieves Guild; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">Thieves Guild Clout 120</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Shadow +5 / Vixen +5 / Arestes +5</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Result / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Nature Walk Date</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Noble Quarter; before recruitment: daily 14–18; afterward: even days 15–18</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acquaintance (50)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; −40 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Sunset Walk Date</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Bards Guild; even days, 18:00–20:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acquaintance (50)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; −40 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">once</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="en-activities"><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><p>Talk gives 1 base point; Perfume gives 6 and Jewelry 10. Their allowances follow her across locations. Drink with Vixen at the Alehouse gives 4 base points, two safe uses daily, for 25 minutes and $45.</p><p>All six lessons require Acquaintance (50), their own stat minimum and an unlearned skill. Each costs 120 minutes, $300, 30 Energy and 40 Calm, and gives 15 base relationship points. The table identifies which venue teaches each skill.</p><p>Expression Mastery at Known (25) and Communication 75 costs 45 minutes and currently grants Attractiveness +1 plus 10 direct relationship points once. Worker management, crafted upgrades and vacation content use the separate business and resort systems.</p><p>Relationship rewards are base values unless marked direct. Shared relationship modifiers affect the final gain. Repeated actions keep their daily allowance when you meet the same character elsewhere.</p><details><summary>Relationship bonuses</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Type</th><th scope="col">Reference</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Favorite stats</th><td data-label="Reference">Rogue 45 / Communication 55 / Charm 60</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Relationship skill</th><td data-label="Reference">Silver Tongue</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Favorite-stat contribution scales toward the listed values. The relationship skill affects the shared relationship multiplier; it is not automatically a skill taught by this character.</p></details><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Result / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Vixen</th><td data-label="Location / start window">VIP Lounge; odd days 11–20; even days 11–15</td><td data-label="Requirements">Romantic (800)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">base relationship +1; 5 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Perfume</th><td data-label="Location / start window">VIP Lounge; odd days 11–20; even days 11–15</td><td data-label="Requirements">Romantic (800)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">10 min; Perfume ×1</td><td data-label="Result / limit">base relationship +6; 3 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Jewelry</th><td data-label="Location / start window">VIP Lounge; odd days 11–20; even days 11–15</td><td data-label="Requirements">Romantic (800)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">10 min; Jewelry ×1</td><td data-label="Result / limit">base relationship +10; 3 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Private Time</th><td data-label="Location / start window">VIP Lounge; odd days 11–20; even days 11–15</td><td data-label="Requirements">relationship 1000</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">30 min; −60 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">base relationship +50; 1 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Vixen</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Noble Quarter; before recruitment: daily 14–18; afterward: even days 15–18</td><td data-label="Requirements">Known (25)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">base relationship +1; 5 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Perfume</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Noble Quarter; before recruitment: daily 14–18; afterward: even days 15–18<br/>Rowdy Alehouse; odd days, 20:00–22:00<br/>Bards Guild; even days, 18:00–22:00<br/>Thieves Guild; even days, 22:00–24:00; odd days, 00:00–02:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Known (25)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">10 min; Perfume ×1</td><td data-label="Result / limit">base relationship +6; 3 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Jewelry</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Noble Quarter; before recruitment: daily 14–18; afterward: even days 15–18<br/>Rowdy Alehouse; odd days, 20:00–22:00<br/>Bards Guild; even days, 18:00–22:00<br/>Thieves Guild; even days, 22:00–24:00; odd days, 00:00–02:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acquaintance (50)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">10 min; Jewelry ×1</td><td data-label="Result / limit">base relationship +10; 3 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Vixen</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Rowdy Alehouse; odd days, 20:00–22:00<br/>Bards Guild; even days, 18:00–22:00<br/>Thieves Guild; even days, 22:00–24:00; odd days, 00:00–02:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">base relationship +1; 5 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Drink with Vixen</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Rowdy Alehouse; odd days, 20:00–22:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acknowledged (10)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">25 min; $45</td><td data-label="Result / limit">base relationship +4; 2 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Reading People</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Rowdy Alehouse; odd days, 20:00–22:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acquaintance (50); Perception 18</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $300; −30 Energy; −40 Calm</td><td data-label="Result / limit">learn Reading People; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Seduction</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Rowdy Alehouse; odd days, 20:00–22:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acquaintance (50); Charm 20</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $300; −30 Energy; −40 Calm</td><td data-label="Result / limit">learn Seduction; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Expression Mastery</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Rowdy Alehouse; odd days, 20:00–22:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Known (25); Communication 75</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">45 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">Attractiveness +1; direct relationship +10; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Information Brokering</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Bards Guild; even days, 18:00–22:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acquaintance (50); Intelligence 18</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $300; −30 Energy; −40 Calm</td><td data-label="Result / limit">learn Information Brokering; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Reputation Management</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Bards Guild; even days, 18:00–22:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acquaintance (50); Charm 16</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $300; −30 Energy; −40 Calm</td><td data-label="Result / limit">learn Reputation Management; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Deception</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Thieves Guild; even days, 22:00–24:00; odd days, 00:00–02:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acquaintance (50); Charm 18</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $300; −30 Energy; −40 Calm</td><td data-label="Result / limit">learn Deception; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Blackmail</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Thieves Guild; even days, 22:00–24:00; odd days, 00:00–02:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acquaintance (50); Perception 20</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $300; −30 Energy; −40 Calm</td><td data-label="Result / limit">learn Blackmail; once</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Gallery_and_Troubleshooting"></span><h2>Missing actions and useful checks</h2><p>An even-day VIP visit ends at 15:00, when her Noble Quarter period begins. The VIP portrait’s ordinary Talk and gifts require Romantic, unlike her earlier venues. Thieves Guild story milestones use faction Clout, not business Reputation.</p></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><p><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationships, dates and intimacy</a> · <a href="game-systems-brothel.html">Brothel operations</a> · <a href="game-systems-thieves-guild.html">Thieves Guild</a> · <a href="game-systems-bards-guild.html">Bards Guild</a> · <a href="game-systems-sirena-isle-resort.html">Sirena Isle Resort</a></p></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Credits_and_Current_Scope"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-All23_Shared_Island_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sunset_Walk_with_Vixen"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sirena_Isle_Activities"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Two_Crafted_Training_Upgrades"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Worker_.2319_Setup_and_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Worker_#19_Setup_and_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-VIP_Lounge_Private_Time"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recruitment_and_Shared_Events"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Dates_and_Best_Choices"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Building_Affection_and_Six_Lessons"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Vixen 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/vixen.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Vixen 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/vixen.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Vixen 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Vixen会出现在中世纪的几处场所，提供六项社交教学、两项约会，后续还有VIP休息室分支。可以按下列场所时段与关系门槛安排活动。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Exact_Schedule"></span><h2>出现地点与时间</h2><p>可以先在单数日20:00—22:00到喧闹酒馆。初见事件本身则在同一晚间时段的任何一天都可触发。已遇见（10）后，可在双数日18:00—22:00到吟游诗人公会，或双数日22:00—24:00及紧接的单数日00:00—02:00到盗贼公会。</p><p>贵族区头像要求已知（25）：招募前每天14:00—18:00，招募后改为仅双数日15:00—18:00。招募后的VIP休息室头像在单数日11:00—20:00、双数日11:00—15:00出现；公会和酒馆的普通日程仍保留。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">头像出现时间</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">喧闹酒馆</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">单数日，20:00–22:00</td><td data-label="条件">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">吟游诗人公会</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">双数日，18:00–22:00</td><td data-label="条件">已遇见（10）</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">盗贼公会</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">双数日，22:00–24:00；单数日，00:00–02:00</td><td data-label="条件">已遇见（10）</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">贵族区</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">招募前每天14:00—18:00；招募后双数日15:00—18:00</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25）</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">VIP休息室</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">单数日11:00—20:00；双数日11:00—15:00</td><td data-label="条件">已招募且员工启用</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>时段按开始动作时判定，结束时间不包含在内。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>达到浪漫感（800）、青楼声誉10后，在双数日18:00—22:00进入吟游诗人公会触发战略合作。完成会招募她，并直接将VIP休息室开放到1级，之后再前往完成休息室初见。</p><p>贵族区的自然漫步与吟游诗人公会的日落漫步是两项独立一次性约会，各消耗120分钟、40精力，不花财富。自然漫步要求相识（50），从贵族区头像发起；日落漫步在双数日18:00—20:00开始。</p><details><summary>展开自动事件的完整开始条件</summary><p>在事件时段进入指定地点即可触发。均为一次性事件，下列固定基础关系奖励与选择奖励另算；未列额外时段表示事件本身不再加设时间限制。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">事件</th><th scope="col">开始地点／时间</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">固定基础关系奖励</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Vixen试探Ava和Eva</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">按摩室; 12:00–24:00</td><td data-label="条件">Ava and Eva 朋友（100）</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">读魂者</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">喧闹酒馆; 20:00–22:00</td><td data-label="条件">Vixen 陌生人（0）；未在度假：Vixen</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Vixen +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">表演的艺术</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">吟游诗人公会; 双数日，16:00–20:00</td><td data-label="条件">Vixen 朋友（100）；Sandra 朋友（100）；未在度假：Sandra、Vixen</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Vixen +10、Sandra +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">贵族之间的白昼</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">贵族区; 14:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">Vixen 已知（25）；未在度假：Vixen</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Vixen +8</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">战略合作</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">吟游诗人公会; 双数日，18:00–22:00</td><td data-label="条件">Vixen 浪漫感（800）；青楼声誉10；未在度假：Vixen</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Vixen +20</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">盛大开业</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">VIP休息室; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">已招募且员工启用：Vixen；未在度假：Elara、Vixen</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Vixen +5、Elara +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">温柔的灵魂</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">VIP休息室; 11:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">完成：盛大开业；已招募且员工启用：Pepper；未在度假：Pepper、Vixen</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Vixen +5、Pepper +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">事物本来的形状</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">吟游诗人公会; 双数日，18:00–22:00</td><td data-label="条件">完成：表演的艺术、盛大开业；已招募且员工启用：Sandra、Vixen；未在度假：Sandra、Vixen</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Vixen +5、Sandra +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">天鹅绒般的手法</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">盗贼公会; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">Vixen 已知（25）；盗贼公会声望5</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Vixen +4</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">安排</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">盗贼公会; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">盗贼公会声望120</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Shadow +5、Vixen +5、Arestes +5</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">动作</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">结果／限制</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">自然散步约会</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">贵族区; 招募前每天14:00—18:00；招募后双数日15:00—18:00</td><td data-label="条件">相识（50）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120分钟；−40 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">日落散步约会</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">吟游诗人公会; 双数日，18:00–20:00</td><td data-label="条件">相识（50）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120分钟；−40 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">一次性</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><h2>行动与奖励</h2><p>交谈给予1点基础关系，香水6点，珠宝10点，各动作额度跟随她跨地点计算。酒馆共饮消耗25分钟、45财富，给予4点基础关系，每日安全额度2次。</p><p>六项教学都要求相识（50）、对应属性门槛及尚未学会该技能；每项消耗120分钟、300财富、30精力、40镇定，给予15点基础关系。下表区分每项技能的教学场所。</p><p>表情精通要求已知（25）、沟通75，花45分钟，当前会一次性给予吸引力+1和10点直接关系。员工管理、制作升级和度假内容则使用独立的经营与度假系统。</p><p>除注明直接增加外，关系奖励均为基础值，最终增量受共通关系修正影响。同一角色换地点不会重置重复动作的每日额度。</p><details><summary>展开关系加成参考</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">类别</th><th scope="col">参考</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">偏好属性</th><td data-label="参考">盗贼 45、沟通 55、魅力 60</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">关系加成技能</th><td data-label="参考">巧舌如簧</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>偏好属性的加成随数值提高，逐步达到所列参考值。关系加成技能影响共通关系倍率，不代表该角色一定负责教授这项技能。</p></details><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">动作</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">结果／限制</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">和 Vixen 交谈</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">VIP休息室; 单数日11:00—20:00；双数日11:00—15:00</td><td data-label="条件">浪漫感（800）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">15分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">基础关系+1；5次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送香水</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">VIP休息室; 单数日11:00—20:00；双数日11:00—15:00</td><td data-label="条件">浪漫感（800）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">10分钟；香水 ×1</td><td data-label="结果／限制">基础关系+6；3次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送珠宝</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">VIP休息室; 单数日11:00—20:00；双数日11:00—15:00</td><td data-label="条件">浪漫感（800）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">10分钟；珠宝 ×1</td><td data-label="结果／限制">基础关系+10；3次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">私人时间</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">VIP休息室; 单数日11:00—20:00；双数日11:00—15:00</td><td data-label="条件">关系点数1000</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">30分钟；−60 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">基础关系+50；1次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">和 Vixen 交谈</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">贵族区; 招募前每天14:00—18:00；招募后双数日15:00—18:00</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">15分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">基础关系+1；5次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送香水</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">贵族区; 招募前每天14:00—18:00；招募后双数日15:00—18:00<br/>喧闹酒馆; 单数日，20:00–22:00<br/>吟游诗人公会; 双数日，18:00–22:00<br/>盗贼公会; 双数日，22:00–24:00；单数日，00:00–02:00</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">10分钟；香水 ×1</td><td data-label="结果／限制">基础关系+6；3次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送珠宝</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">贵族区; 招募前每天14:00—18:00；招募后双数日15:00—18:00<br/>喧闹酒馆; 单数日，20:00–22:00<br/>吟游诗人公会; 双数日，18:00–22:00<br/>盗贼公会; 双数日，22:00–24:00；单数日，00:00–02:00</td><td data-label="条件">相识（50）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">10分钟；珠宝 ×1</td><td data-label="结果／限制">基础关系+10；3次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">和 Vixen 交谈</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">喧闹酒馆; 单数日，20:00–22:00<br/>吟游诗人公会; 双数日，18:00–22:00<br/>盗贼公会; 双数日，22:00–24:00；单数日，00:00–02:00</td><td data-label="条件">陌生人（0）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">15分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">基础关系+1；5次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">与Vixen喝酒</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">喧闹酒馆; 单数日，20:00–22:00</td><td data-label="条件">已遇见（10）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">25分钟；财富45</td><td data-label="结果／限制">基础关系+4；2次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">识人术</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">喧闹酒馆; 单数日，20:00–22:00</td><td data-label="条件">相识（50）；感知18</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120分钟；财富300；−30 精力；−40 镇定</td><td data-label="结果／限制">学会识人术；一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">诱惑</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">喧闹酒馆; 单数日，20:00–22:00</td><td data-label="条件">相识（50）；魅力20</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120分钟；财富300；−30 精力；−40 镇定</td><td data-label="结果／限制">学会诱惑；一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">表情精通</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">喧闹酒馆; 单数日，20:00–22:00</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25）；沟通75</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">45分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">吸引力+1；直接关系+10；一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">情报交易</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">吟游诗人公会; 双数日，18:00–22:00</td><td data-label="条件">相识（50）；智力18</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120分钟；财富300；−30 精力；−40 镇定</td><td data-label="结果／限制">学会情报交易；一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">声望管理</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">吟游诗人公会; 双数日，18:00–22:00</td><td data-label="条件">相识（50）；魅力16</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120分钟；财富300；−30 精力；−40 镇定</td><td data-label="结果／限制">学会声望管理；一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">欺骗</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">盗贼公会; 双数日，22:00–24:00；单数日，00:00–02:00</td><td data-label="条件">相识（50）；魅力18</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120分钟；财富300；−30 精力；−40 镇定</td><td data-label="结果／限制">学会欺骗；一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">勒索</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">盗贼公会; 双数日，22:00–24:00；单数日，00:00–02:00</td><td data-label="条件">相识（50）；感知20</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120分钟；财富300；−30 精力；−40 镇定</td><td data-label="结果／限制">学会勒索；一次性</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Gallery_and_Troubleshooting"></span><h2>动作缺失时的检查</h2><p>双数日的VIP休息室拜访在15:00结束，接着才是贵族区时段。贵宾头像的普通交谈和礼物要求浪漫感，不同于早期场所。盗贼公会事件检查的是派系声望，不是青楼声誉。</p></section>
